OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to Manx Radio
OL,4,Apioneer Charlie Webster
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to former Manx
OL,7,FRadio senior producer Charlie Webster,
OL,8,Fwho has died after a career at the
OL,9,Fstation spanning nearly 40 years.
OL,11,FThe broadcaster said the "true Manx
OL,12,Fcharacter" had played "an enormous
OL,13,Frole" in the station's evolution.
OL,15,FWebster, who died at the age of 85,
OL,16,Fjoined Manx Radio in 1965 a year after
OL,17,Fit launched. During the station's early
OL,18,Fdays it broadcast from a caravan on
OL,19,FDouglas seafront.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
