OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to Manx Radio
OL,4,Apioneer Charlie Webster
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe later worked with longtime colleague
OL,7,FEwan Leeming to build the "aquarium"
OL,8,Fstudios on Douglas Promenade, with the
OL,9,Fpair working around the clock at
OL,10,Ftransmitter sites across the island
OL,11,Fwhen they had to switch equipment on
OL,12,Fand off manually at the start and end
OL,13,Fof each day.
